{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Unfunded CTA shown while balance loads\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\n`hasNoAvailableBalance` no longer waits for the live account to finish loading, and `isSubmitDisabled` dropped the `isLoadingAccount` guard. `getTradeableBalance` returns `0` when `account` is null, so a funded wallet looks unfunded until the stream arrives. The primary button becomes an enabled Add funds to trade control and can open a deposit instead of waiting for the real balance.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: e39a1b21-675e-4708-9c36-4fd388a67269 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L882-L886\nui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L363-L364\nui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L1079-L1094\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (2)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L363-L364`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/c45015c2ea708fc99b82fe14d60dcec1b4f7d7c0/ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L363-L364)\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L1079-L1094`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/c45015c2ea708fc99b82fe14d60dcec1b4f7d7c0/ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L1079-L1094)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"n