{"author":"cursor[bot]","body":"### Row CTA ignores account loading\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nThe available-to-trade row now shows a labeled `Add funds` control whenever `availableBalance` is below `PERPS_UNFUNDED_BALANCE_THRESHOLD_USDC`. While the account stream is still loading, `getTradeableBalance` falls back to `0`, so funded users can briefly (or longer) see the unfunded row CTA even though the footer correctly waits on `isLoadingAccount` and does not switch to `Add funds to trade`. Clicking that row control can open deposit during hydration and is tracked as a funded add-funds click because `hasNoAvailableBalance` is still false.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 0a6d9d26-28a2-4ac9-9388-48e37963dac0 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/components/app/perps/order-entry/components/amount-input/amount-input.tsx#L411-L422\nui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L881-L887\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L881-L887`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/002b882c412dba3dc489e0752d9060612c4dbdd2/ui/pages/perps/perps-order-entry-page.tsx#L881-L887)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefer